/build/

# The help files, which are published in their own repositories (see the README)
examples/pfcexamp.pdf
examples/pfcdlg.pdf

# Binary PowerBuilder libraries: build them from ws_objects instead. A PBL
# kept in git still holds objects later deleted from ws_objects, and
# rebuilding into it (as Connect to Workspace does) brings them back.
# Converting to Solution mode turns these paths into source folders, so
# remove these lines (or add !/examples/*.pbl/ and !/demoapp/peat.pbl/) then.
/demoapp/peat.pbl
/examples/*.pbl
